  "name": "LogisticsPolicy - Default (seed v1)",
  "description": "A town logistics policy (town logistics P9, #127, TOWN_LOGISTICS § 4): a town's, a warehouse's, or a default template per town size and specialization (D-L3). Every save makes a new version (the old one stays for the history). The rules are edited in the web app's policy editor (or PUT api/LogisticsPolicies/{id} with the whole rule list); a template is copied into a town with POST api/LogisticsPolicies/{id}/apply.",
  "steps": [
    {
